lunduke-city (0.7-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * LCOS 0.7-2 on the 0.7 track. New City is a three-step wizard
    (name, difficulty / terrain / seed, generate) wired to the engine
    game level and terrain generator. Windows → Graphs charts the
    engine history. Windows → Evaluation is a full score, opinion, and
    problems window. System → Rename City updates the engine name and
    the window title. About is a proper dialog (version 0.7-2, GPL and
    NOTICE, no Electronic Arts affiliation).
  * Keeps the 0.3 / 0.7-1 map, sprites, budget, sound, overlays,
    Ctrl-+ zoom, placement preview, Play Scenario, and icon.

 -- LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:40:00 +0000

lunduke-city (0.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * LCOS 0.7 release-track identity bump (0.7-1). Same application as
    0.3-1: Ctrl-+ zoom without Shift, placement footprint preview,
    System → Play Scenario…, and the roadmap icon (SVG, hicolor, and
    window set_icon). No feature changes.

 -- LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 02:30:00 +0000

lunduke-city (0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Lunduke City 0.3: Ctrl-+ zooms in without Shift, placement preview
    outlines, and System → Play Scenario… for the eight engine scenarios.
  * Vendored scenario cities (res/snro.*) from the same Micropolis commit
    as the engine.
  * App icon is the roadmap blueprint (data/lunduke-city.svg plus
    hicolor PNGs at 16, 32, 48, 64, 128, and 256). Window uses
    set_default_icon_name and set_icon_name("lunduke-city").

 -- LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 01:10:00 +0000

lunduke-city (0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of Lunduke City 0.2 for LCOS.
  * gtkmm 3 shell: tiles, sprites, budget, map overlays, PulseAudio sounds.
  * Ships NOTICE (GPL-3+ and EA additional terms) and COPYING under
    /usr/share/doc/lunduke-city/.
  * Vendored Micropolis engine + assets under /usr/share/lunduke-city/.

 -- Phil <phil@brushpad.local>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 18:34:00 -0500
